The one-dimensional case is familiar in A-Level context -- the Newton--Raphson method is a root finding algorithm for \(f'\pqty{x} = g\pqty{x}\):
\[
 x_{t + 1} = x_t - \frac{g\pqty{x_t}}{g'\pqty{x_t}}.
\]

