\begin{corollary} 
If $\Omega$ has compact closure $\closure\Omega$, $f$ is holomorphic on $\Omega$ and
continuous on $\closure\Omega$, then $\sup_{\closure\Omega}\abs f=\sup_{\partial\Omega}
\abs f$.
\end{corollary}

