Type: theorem
Label: t:productpre@c29
Local macros: \sA := \mathcal{A}; \sM := \mathcal{M}
Content:
\begin{theorem} 
$\mu_0$ is a premeasure on $\sA$, so by the extension theorem it generates a measure
