\begin{center}
\par

\captionof{figure}{Two extremes: $\nu\perp\mu$ live on disjoint carriers; $\nu\ll\mu$
shares $\mu$'s null sets. Radon--Nikodym says every $\nu$ splits into one of each.
(Schematic.)}
