the product of the duals, $\widehat{Z(2)\times Z(3)}\cong\widehat{Z(2)}\times\widehat{Z(3)}$,
so a character of $Z(6)$ factors as a $Z(2)$-character times a $Z(3)$-character.}
\end{center}

