For $f\in B_1$ take $f_n\in S$, $f_n\to f$. Then $\norm{T_0 f_n-T_0 f_m}\le M\norm{f_n-f_m}
\to0$, so $\set{T_0 f_n}$ is Cauchy in the complete space $B_2$; define $Tf=\lim T_0 f_n$
