Title: Warm Up
Content:
\begin{problem}[Warm Up]
Are these groups?
\begin{parts}
\part[w:1a] $(Z/nZ, \times)$;
\part[w:1b] $(Z/nZ \setminus \{0\}, \times)$
\end{parts}
\end{problem}

