\begin{proposition}
The following are equivalent:
\begin{itemize}
\item $N \normal G$;
\item $gNg^{-1} \subset N$ for all $g \in G$ (note this implies they are equal since conjugation is injective);
\item $N$ is the kernel of some homomorphism $\pi : G \to H$ for some $H \leq G$.
\end{itemize}
\end{proposition}

