Title: Forward references: $S_n$, $D_{2n}$, $\GL$
Label: r:forwardgroups-mrg@c1
Content:
\begin{remark}[Forward references: $S_n$, $D_{2n}$, $\GL$] 
Three families that D\&F flag here and construct in detail shortly:
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(i)] the symmetric group $S_n$ of all bijections of $\{1,2,\dots,n\}$ to itself under composition, $|S_n|=n!$, nonabelian for $n\ge3$ (identity $\id$, inverse the inverse permutation);
\item[(ii)] the dihedral group $D_{2n}$ of the $2n$ symmetries of a regular $n$-gon, with presentation $r^n=s^2=1$, $sr=r^{-1} s$ (so $|D_{2n}|=2n$), nonabelian for $n\ge3$;
\item[(iii)] the general linear group $\GL_n(R)$ (more generally $\GL_n(F)$ over a field $F$) of invertible $n\times n$ matrices under matrix multiplication, identity the matrix $I$, inverse the matrix inverse, nonabelian for $n\ge2$.
\end{enumerate}
In each case associativity is inherited (composition of functions, multiplication of matrices), and the work is identifying the identity and confirming every element is invertible.
\end{remark}

