Title: Basic identities
Label: p:basic@c1
Content:
\begin{proposition}[Basic identities] 
Let $\varphi:G\to H$ be a homomorphism. Then
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(1)] $\varphi(1_G)=1_H$;
\item[(2)] $\varphi(x^{-1})=\varphi(x)^{-1}$ for all $x\in G$;
\item[(3)] $\varphi(x^n)=\varphi(x)^n$ for all $x\in G$ and all $n\inZ$.
\end{enumerate}
\end{proposition}

