\begin{method}{Tensor products over a PID / commutative ring}
\textit{Trigger.} $R$ commutative (often a PID like $\mathbb{Z}$ or $F[x]$) and $M,N$ finitely generated.
\begin{enumerate}
\item Decompose each module into cyclic pieces $R/(a)$ (structure theorem); $R$ itself is $R/(0)$.
\item Use bilinearity of $\otimes$ over $\oplus$: $\big(\bigoplus_i R/(a_i)\big)\otimes_R\big(\bigoplus_j R/(b_j)\big)\cong\bigoplus_{i,j}R/(a_i)\otimes_R R/(b_j)$.
