\begin{proof}\label{tmua-2-unit-004}
    Write \(P\pqty{x} = \pqty{x - a} D\pqty{x} + R\pqty{x}\) and observe \(R\) has degree less than \(1\), hence constant. Plug in \(x = a\).
\end{proof}

